{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】本港今日(10月16日)天氣預測，初時天色大致良好，日間部分時間有陽光，最高氣溫約30度，晚上有一兩陣微雨，吹和緩東風，風勢間中清勁。</p><p>展望明日有一兩陣雨，重陽節初時雲量仍然較多，稍後至下周初漸轉天晴乾燥，下周中期日間炎熱。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T01:44:54.095907+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T23:13:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T04:57:57.539543+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:45.875135+00:00","content_hash":"f31e3c9b7c60dce04240d490585dbe42d080d7291815b80d4bfef035cf108b74","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}